+export default function Privacy(){return <LegalLayout title="Privacy notice"><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>We process account details, contact information, authentication events, device and security logs, challenge activity, simulated trades, payment references, payout wallet addresses, support messages and identity-verification status.</p><h2>Why we use it</h2><p>We use data to provide accounts, operate evaluations, prevent fraud, secure the platform, review payments and rewards, answer support requests, meet legal obligations and improve reliability.</p><h2>Service providers</h2><p>Data may be processed by hosting, database, authentication, market-data, blockchain analytics, identity verification, email and monitoring providers under appropriate contractual controls. We do not sell personal data.</p><h2>Retention</h2><p>Account and transaction records are retained for the period reasonably necessary for service delivery, security, disputes and applicable legal obligations. Retention periods may differ by record type and jurisdiction.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>Subject to applicable law, you may request access, correction, deletion, restriction or a portable copy of your data. Some records cannot be deleted immediately where they are required for fraud prevention, accounting, disputes or legal compliance.</p><h2>Security and international processing</h2><p>We use access controls, encrypted transport, restricted service credentials and audit records. No system is perfectly secure. Providers may process data in other countries with safeguards required by applicable law.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Send privacy requests from your registered email to <strong>support@takeprop.com</strong>. We may verify your identity before completing a request.</p></LegalLayout>}
